        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiŋenyak Eliu ŋikonei a Yob",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋikilyok ŋuluuni ŋul tojoŋoto aboŋonokin Yob ŋakiro, anerae arae Yob ituŋanan ŋini eyookino anatameta keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Eliu lokoku a Barakel a ŋolo anateker a Bus a ŋolo alokal a Ram toŋo. Abu iŋes toŋoik Yob, anerae abu kitogogoŋ erwor itojoka iŋes bon akilo tari akitojokit Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋoit daŋ iŋes aŋuna a ŋikonei a Yob a ŋuluuni, anerae apotu ikes nyiyookis ŋakiro ŋuna aboŋonokinete ikes Yob, tari daŋ ŋina alimunitotor ikes atemar edyakarit Yob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sek ekiŋaren, eliliŋi Eliu, edarit akisirworikin Yob, anerae adit iŋes aneni a ŋikonei a Yob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eyenuni Eliu atemar nyeboŋokino ŋikilyok ŋuluuni ŋul ŋakiro ejok, abu iŋes toŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok Eliu lokoku a Barakel a ŋolo anateker a Bus ŋakiro tema, “Adit ayoŋ, ido imojoŋito iyes; aŋun, abu ayoŋ okuryaniar ka abu okobul",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
